  "Which field is the entry threshold. Test: damage a tank step by step and note the health at which the critical warning and slowed regeneration start (200 or 400).",
  "Whether 'disabled' in the row names is the same state as EA's 'critical health'; the join is by meaning, not by a stored link.",
  "Where the slowdown factor is stored."
 ],
